  "text": "Hemorroidal bleeding and pin prick red spots on upper arms and forearms.\nMedcial terms:  thrombocytopenia and purpura.\nAlong with gas, sore throat, constipation.\nRinging in my ears.\nDrug induced thrombocytopenia is relatively rare.\nI also have an allergy to penicillin and sulfa drugs.\nPerhaps there is a conneciton.\nI was also taking clarinex with the ranitidine (actually taking the generic).\nClarinex could also be giving me a sore throat.\nAlso have mulitple environmental allergies...trees pollens mold.\n",
